// retired from this file's rendering path since Pro's coverage and fidelity
// are strictly better for every name it covers. Raw SVG inner markup, one
// <path>/<g> block per entry (opacity attributes kept as authored; every
// hardcoded hex color replaced by currentColor so it paints in the
// caller's color, same contract as the hand-drawn stroke set).
//
